On $\Q^4$, take the diagonal operators with diagonal lists
\[
(1,1,1,0),\quad(2,2,0,0),\quad(3,0,0,0),\quad(0,4,4,4)
\]
and target scalars $(1,2,3,4)$. All four targets occur individually. Imposing
