This completes Claim 11.2 at its conditional source scope, on the same counting
basis used for Claim 8.2 in the \hyperref[book:x-construction-23]{conditional completion construction}. The full arithmetic application premises
remain separate. In particular, the criterion does not prove universal occupancy,
Hodge--Tate or Weil--Deligne attachment, or the Frobenius recovery clause of
